---
// Visual showdown: letting user uploads' intrinsic aspect ratios drive card height
// versus locking containers to a fixed aspect-ratio (4:3) and cropping with object-fit: cover.
const W = 900;
const H = 430;
---
<figure class="img-cc">
  <div class="img-cc-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Left: three cards with unconstrained image heights producing a ragged row when users upload 16:9, 3:4, and 1:1 photos. Right: three aligned cards using a fixed 4:3 container and object-fit cover, with dashed outlines showing the cropped overflow.">
      {/* Left half: Unconstrained (intrinsic aspect ratios) */}
      <text x="20" y="26" class="img-cc-h is-bad">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1. Unconstrained uploads (intrinsic ratio drives layout)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Thả trôi ảnh tải lên (tỷ lệ gốc quyết định bố cục)</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Card 1: Wide 16:9 */}
      <g transform="translate(20, 44)">
        <rect x="0" y="0" width="128" height="148" rx="7" class="img-cc-card is-bad" />
        <rect x="10" y="10" width="108" height="60" rx="4" class="img-cc-photo" />
        <text x="64" y="44" text-anchor="middle" class="img-cc-ratio">16:9</text>
        <rect x="10" y="84" width="84" height="8" rx="3" fill="var(--text)" opacity="0.75" />
        <rect x="10" y="100" width="60" height="6" rx="3" fill="var(--text-muted)" opacity="0.55" />
        <rect x="10" y="114" width="96" height="6" rx="3" fill="var(--text-muted)" opacity="0.4" />
      </g>

      {/* Card 2: Tall 3:4 phone shot */}
      <g transform="translate(160, 44)">
        <rect x="0" y="0" width="128" height="236" rx="7" class="img-cc-card is-bad" />
        <rect x="10" y="10" width="108" height="148" rx="4" class="img-cc-photo" />
        <text x="64" y="88" text-anchor="middle" class="img-cc-ratio">3:4</text>
        <rect x="10" y="172" width="88" height="8" rx="3" fill="var(--text)" opacity="0.75" />
        <rect x="10" y="188" width="64" height="6" rx="3" fill="var(--text-muted)" opacity="0.55" />
        <rect x="10" y="202" width="92" height="6" rx="3" fill="var(--text-muted)" opacity="0.4" />
      </g>

      {/* Card 3: Square 1:1 */}
      <g transform="translate(300, 44)">
        <rect x="0" y="0" width="128" height="196" rx="7" class="img-cc-card is-bad" />
        <rect x="10" y="10" width="108" height="108" rx="4" class="img-cc-photo" />
        <text x="64" y="68" text-anchor="middle" class="img-cc-ratio">1:1</text>
        <rect x="10" y="132" width="80" height="8" rx="3" fill="var(--text)" opacity="0.75" />
        <rect x="10" y="148" width="56" height="6" rx="3" fill="var(--text-muted)" opacity="0.55" />
        <rect x="10" y="162" width="94" height="6" rx="3" fill="var(--text-muted)" opacity="0.4" />
      </g>

      {/* Ragged bottom baseline indicator */}
      <path d="M 20 198 L 148 198 L 160 286 L 288 286 L 300 246 L 428 246" fill="none" stroke="var(--red)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="5 4" />
      <text x="20" y="314" class="img-cc-note">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Three ratios produce three jagged card heights.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Ba tỷ lệ ảnh tạo ra ba chiều cao thẻ lởm chởm.</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="20" y="336" class="img-cc-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Content below shifts as each image finishes loading.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Nội dung bên dưới bị giật nhảy khi từng ảnh tải xong.</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Center divider */}
      <line x1="450" y1="20" x2="450" y2="405" stroke="var(--border)" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="4 4" />

      {/* Right half: Fixed 4:3 container + object-fit: cover */}
      <text x="472" y="26" class="img-cc-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>2. Fixed 4:3 frame + object-fit: cover</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Khung cứng 4:3 + object-fit: cover</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Card 1: 16:9 cropped horizontally into 4:3 */}
      <g transform="translate(472, 44)">
        <rect x="0" y="0" width="128" height="170" rx="7" class="img-cc-card" />
        {/* Dashed overflow left & right */}
        <rect x="-4" y="10" width="136" height="81" rx="3" class="img-cc-overflow" />
        <rect x="10" y="10" width="108" height="81" rx="4" class="img-cc-photo is-fixed" />
        <text x="64" y="55" text-anchor="middle" class="img-cc-ratio">4:3</text>
        <rect x="10" y="106" width="84" height="8" rx="3" fill="var(--text)" opacity="0.75" />
        <rect x="10" y="122" width="60" height="6" rx="3" fill="var(--text-muted)" opacity="0.55" />
        <rect x="10" y="136" width="96" height="6" rx="3" fill="var(--text-muted)" opacity="0.4" />
      </g>

      {/* Card 2: 3:4 cropped vertically into 4:3 */}
      <g transform="translate(612, 44)">
        <rect x="0" y="0" width="128" height="170" rx="7" class="img-cc-card" />
        {/* Dashed overflow top & bottom */}
        <rect x="10" y="-4" width="108" height="109" rx="3" class="img-cc-overflow" />
        <rect x="10" y="10" width="108" height="81" rx="4" class="img-cc-photo is-fixed" />
        <text x="64" y="55" text-anchor="middle" class="img-cc-ratio">4:3</text>
        <rect x="10" y="106" width="88" height="8" rx="3" fill="var(--text)" opacity="0.75" />
        <rect x="10" y="122" width="64" height="6" rx="3" fill="var(--text-muted)" opacity="0.55" />
        <rect x="10" y="136" width="92" height="6" rx="3" fill="var(--text-muted)" opacity="0.4" />
      </g>

      {/* Card 3: 1:1 cropped slightly top & bottom into 4:3 */}
      <g transform="translate(752, 44)">
        <rect x="0" y="0" width="128" height="170" rx="7" class="img-cc-card" />
        <rect x="10" y="1" width="108" height="99" rx="3" class="img-cc-overflow" />
        <rect x="10" y="10" width="108" height="81" rx="4" class="img-cc-photo is-fixed" />
        <text x="64" y="55" text-anchor="middle" class="img-cc-ratio">4:3</text>
        <rect x="10" y="106" width="80" height="8" rx="3" fill="var(--text)" opacity="0.75" />
        <rect x="10" y="122" width="56" height="6" rx="3" fill="var(--text-muted)" opacity="0.55" />
        <rect x="10" y="136" width="94" height="6" rx="3" fill="var(--text-muted)" opacity="0.4" />
      </g>

      {/* Straight aligned bottom line */}
      <line x1="472" y1="224" x2="880" y2="224" stroke="var(--text-muted)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="5 4" />
      <text x="472" y="252" class="img-cc-note">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Every card locks to the same 4:3 frame before load.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Mọi thẻ khóa cứng tỷ lệ 4:3 trước khi ảnh kịp tải.</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="472" y="274" class="img-cc-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Dashed rectangles show excess pixels cleanly clipped</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Khung nét đứt là phần ảnh thừa được cắt gọn mà không</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="472" y="294" class="img-cc-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>without stretching or distorting the subject.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>làm méo hay bóp dẹt chủ thể bên trong.</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Legend at bottom right */}
      <g transform="translate(472, 330)">
        <rect x="0" y="0" width="22" height="14" rx="2" class="img-cc-overflow" />
        <text x="30" y="11" class="img-cc-meta">
          <tspan data-lang-en>Cropped overflow (hidden by container)</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>Phần ảnh thừa bị khung cắt gọn</tspan>
        </text>
      </g>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Never let user uploads dictate card geometry. Lock the container with aspect-ratio and let object-fit: cover trim the excess.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Đừng để ảnh người dùng tải lên quyết định hình dáng thẻ. Hãy khóa khung bằng aspect-ratio và để object-fit: cover cắt gọn phần thừa.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .img-cc { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .img-cc-scroll { overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; }
  .img-cc svg { min-width: 640px; width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; font-family: inherit; }
  .img-cc-h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .img-cc-h.is-bad { fill: var(--red); }
  .img-cc-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .img-cc-card.is-bad { stroke: var(--red); }
  .img-cc-photo { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .img-cc-photo.is-fixed { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .img-cc-overflow { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-faint); stroke-width: 1.1; stroke-dasharray: 3 3; }
  .img-cc-ratio { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text-muted); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .img-cc-note { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .img-cc-sub { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .img-cc-meta { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .img-cc figcaption { margin-top: 0.75em; text-align: center; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); }
</style>
